    "The address devices on the same Wi‑Fi use to connect. Hide VPN or virtual addresses so they aren’t offered for pairing.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一 Wi‑Fi 下的设备用这个地址连接。隐藏 VPN 或虚拟地址，免得配对时出现它们。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "同一 Wi‑Fi 下的裝置用這個位址連線。隱藏 VPN 或虛擬位址，免得配對時出現它們。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The listen address is already in use. Another server may be running.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "监听地址已被占用，可能有别的服务器在运行。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "監聽位址已被占用，可能有別的伺服器在執行。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The offline test contact passes messages between this Mac and the phone. Nothing is ever delivered.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "离线测试联系人只在这台 Mac 和手机之间传递消息，不会真的发出去。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "離線測試聯絡人只在這台 Mac 和手機之間傳遞訊息，不會真的傳出去。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The running backend opens chat.db with immutable=1, so it predates the malformed-database fix. Restart it with the latest backend.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行中的后端以 immutable=1 打开 chat.db，版本早于数据库损坏修复。请用最新后端重启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "執行中的後端以 immutable=1 開啟 chat.db，版本早於資料庫損壞修正。請用最新後端重新啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The running server doesn't report its build, so it predates v0.15 and lacks recent sync fixes. Restart it with the latest backend.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "运行中的服务器不报告版本，说明早于 v0.15，缺少近期的同步修复。请用最新后端重启。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "執行中的伺服器不回報版本，表示早於 v0.15，缺少近期的同步修正。請用最新後端重新啟動。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The selected backend (%@) doesn't report a version, so it predates v0.15 and lacks recent sync fixes. Rebuild it with MicaGoServer/micago-server/scripts/build-backend.sh": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所选后端（%@）不报告版本，说明早于 v0.15，缺少近期的同步修复。请用 MicaGoServer/micago-server/scripts/build-backend.sh 重新构建。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所選後端（%@）不回報版本，表示早於 v0.15，缺少近期的同步修正。請用 MicaGoServer/micago-server/scripts/build-backend.sh 重新建置。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server configuration is missing or invalid (~/.micago/config.yaml).": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器配置缺失或无效（~/.micago/config.yaml）。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器設定遺失或無效（~/.micago/config.yaml）。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The server is up but rejected the token. Check %@.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "服务器在运行，但拒绝了令牌。请检查 %@。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "伺服器在執行，但拒絕了權杖。請檢查 %@。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The tunnel answered, but no server is behind it (%lld). Make sure micaGO is running and the tunnel forwards to its port.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "隧道有响应，但后面没有服务器（%lld）。请确认 micaGO 正在运行，并且隧道转发到它的端口。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通道有回應，但後面沒有伺服器（%lld）。請確認 micaGO 正在執行，並且通道轉送到它的連接埠。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "These rules override the default policy for one chat or handle. Chat rules win over handle rules, and both win over the default.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这些规则会覆盖某个聊天或地址的默认策略。聊天规则优先于地址规则，两者都优先于默认策略。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這些規則會覆蓋某個聊天或地址的預設原則。聊天規則優先於地址規則，兩者都優先於預設原則。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This build of micaGO doesn’t include the IMCore helper, so it can’t be installed automatically. Edit, Unsend, and Delete stay hidden until you install a build that includes it.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个 micaGO 版本没有附带 IMCore 助手，无法自动安装。装上附带助手的版本前，编辑、撤回和删除会一直隐藏。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這個 micaGO 版本沒有附帶 IMCore 輔助程式，無法自動安裝。裝上附帶輔助程式的版本前，編輯、收回和刪除會一直隱藏。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This file stays on the Mac. The server uses it to send pushes.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这个文件只留在 Mac 上，服务器用它发送推送。"
