    "macOS manages Contacts access. Open System Settings → Privacy & Security → Contacts and turn on micaGO Companion. Without it, contact names may not show, but chats still work with phone numbers or email addresses.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "通讯录权限由 macOS 管理。打开“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 通讯录”，打开 micaGO Companion。没有权限时联系人名字可能不显示，但聊天仍可用号码或邮箱正常收发。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "聯絡人權限由 macOS 管理。打開「系統設定 → 隱私權與安全性 → 聯絡人」，開啟 micaGO Companion。沒有權限時聯絡人名字可能不顯示，但聊天仍可用號碼或電子郵件正常收發。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "micaGO": {
      "comment": "Sidebar items in the main content area.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
