    "micaGO Companion": {
      "comment": "The name of the app.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "micaGO can't read the Messages database. Give micaGO Companion Full Disk Access, then start the server again.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "micaGO 读不到信息数据库。请给 micaGO Companion 完全磁盘访问权限，然后重新启动服务器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "micaGO 讀不到訊息資料庫。請給 micaGO Companion 完整磁碟取用權限，然後重新啟動伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "micaGO listens on your local network so devices on the same Wi‑Fi can connect. This applies to the server Companion starts.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "micaGO 在局域网上监听，让同一 Wi‑Fi 下的设备能连上。这里的设置用于 Companion 启动的服务器。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "micaGO 在區域網路上監聽，讓同一 Wi‑Fi 下的裝置能連上。這裡的設定用於 Companion 啟動的伺服器。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
