    "—": {
      "comment": "A placeholder value for a picker",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true
    },
    "“Sender & message” puts the message text in the push, which goes through Google FCM. Pick “Sender only” or “None” to keep message text off Google's servers.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "“发送者和消息”会把消息内容放进推送，经由 Google FCM 发送。不想让消息内容经过 Google 服务器，请选“仅发送者”或“无”。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「傳送者和訊息」會把訊息內容放進推播，經由 Google FCM 傳送。不想讓訊息內容經過 Google 伺服器，請選「僅傳送者」或「無」。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "• micaGO has no cloud server. You use your own Firebase project.\n• Firebase is only used for Android push and the optional public URL lookup.\n• Windows clients get notifications over WebSocket while they run. Huawei/HarmonyOS push isn't supported yet, and iOS push isn't planned.\n• Firebase never stores message content, contacts, phone numbers, tokens, attachments, chat history, the device list, or sync rules.\n• A push only carries delivery data. Message history still syncs over your normal micaGO connection.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• micaGO 没有云端服务器，你用的是自己的 Firebase 项目。\n• Firebase 只用于安卓推送和可选的公网 URL 查询。\n• Windows 客户端运行时通过 WebSocket 接收通知。暂不支持华为/鸿蒙推送，也没有 iOS 推送计划。\n• Firebase 不会存储消息内容、联系人、电话号码、令牌、附件、聊天记录、设备列表或同步规则。\n• 推送只携带送达信息，消息记录仍通过你平常的 micaGO 连接同步。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "• micaGO 沒有雲端伺服器，你用的是自己的 Firebase 專案。\n• Firebase 只用於 Android 推播和選用的公開 URL 查詢。\n• Windows 用戶端執行時透過 WebSocket 接收通知。暫不支援華為/鴻蒙推播，也沒有 iOS 推播計畫。\n• Firebase 不會儲存訊息內容、聯絡人、電話號碼、權杖、附件、聊天記錄、裝置列表或同步規則。\n• 推播只攜帶送達資訊，訊息記錄仍透過你平常的 micaGO 連線同步。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
